WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:30.250
After inviting Arjun

2
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.625
to behold His Vishwarupa,

3
00:00:32.625 --> 00:00:34.583
Lord Krishna makes clear

4
00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:35.875
that Arjun's current

5
00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:36.958
human sight

6
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:40.250
is not sufficient to see it.

7
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.666
So Lord Krishna

8
00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:44.875
grants Arjun divya drishti – divine sight,

9
00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:46.166
which enables him

10
00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:50.458
to behold this magnificent display of power.

11
00:00:55.291 --> 00:00:56.875
Lord Krishna says

12
00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:58.250
that Arjun with his ordinary

13
00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:01.333
eyes cannot behold His Vishwarupa.

14
00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:02.875
This is not because

15
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:06.375
Arjun lacks faith or devotion,

16
00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:09.583
but because human sight

17
00:01:09.583 --> 00:01:11.458
is naturally limited

18
00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:14.666
to perceiving only material forms.

19
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:15.958
The vision of the Vishwarupa

20
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:18.833
is not an ordinary sight.

21
00:01:18.833 --> 00:01:20.208
It is an overwhelming revelation

22
00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:24.375
of Lord Krishna's divine glories.

23
00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:27.458
In it, past, present, and future

24
00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:30.250
are all contained within a single form.

25
00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.833
Since such a vision is beyond material sight,

26
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:35.208
Lord Krishna

27
00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:37.166
grants Arjun the divine eyes

28
00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:40.541
needed to behold it.

29
00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:42.708
Arjun, through this request,

30
00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:44.333
for the coming generations

31
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:46.250
too wishes to confirm

32
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.500
Lord Krishna's supreme position.

33
00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.583
The Gita is not just a personal dialogue.

34
00:01:52.583 --> 00:01:56.416
It is a timeless scripture for the world.

35
00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.000
By beholding the Vishwarupa

36
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.708
and later affirming Lord Krishna's supremacy,

37
00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:03.875
Arjun ensures

38
00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:06.708
that future seekers will recognise Lord Krishna

39
00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:09.625
not just through theoretical philosophy,

40
00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:14.500
but also through His directly revealed form.

41
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:22.500
When you receive knowledge,

42
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.750
then this world, you

43
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:31.166
begin to see with a different vision.

44
00:02:31.166 --> 00:02:34.375
So, just as I,

45
00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:38.458
Arjun, to behold My Vishwarupa,

46
00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:41.291
gave you the eyes to understand –

47
00:02:41.291 --> 00:02:43.375
something that was

48
00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:46.916
beyond ordinary sight,

49
00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:48.416
in the same way

50
00:02:48.416 --> 00:02:52.791
you too, to understand the deeper truths of life,

51
00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:56.125
must expand your understanding.

52
00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:58.250
Without the right knowledge,

53
00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.541
some realities remain hidden.

54
00:03:01.541 --> 00:03:04.541
They exist, but

55
00:03:04.541 --> 00:03:07.750
because you do not have the means

56
00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:11.541
to see them, they remain invisible to you.

57
00:03:11.541 --> 00:03:17.500
This happens in both spiritual and material life.

58
00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.500
For example,

59
00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:24.791
take the microscope of science.

60
00:03:24.791 --> 00:03:29.333
It shows those extremely tiny germs

61
00:03:29.333 --> 00:03:33.833
that ordinary eyes cannot see.

62
00:03:33.833 --> 00:03:37.583
In the same way, spiritual knowledge

63
00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:41.208
shows that dimension of life

64
00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:44.208
which otherwise remains unseen to you.

65
00:03:44.208 --> 00:03:50.583
It opens your inner sight.

66
00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:53.875
It helps you see the purpose, relationships,

67
00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:57.750
and the whole of your life.

68
00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.291
The teachings of the Gita

69
00:03:59.291 --> 00:04:02.833
serve as those divine eyes,

70
00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:06.750
which naturally take you
beyond surface experiences

71
00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:10.375
to understand the deeper meaning of life,

72
00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:12.958
guiding you.

73
00:04:12.958 --> 00:04:16.875
What you cannot yet see or understand,

74
00:04:16.875 --> 00:04:19.583
instead of doubting it,

75
00:04:19.583 --> 00:04:23.333
focus on expanding your awareness.

76
00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:27.750
Study, reflect, and move forward.

77
00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:31.166
As your understanding deepens,

78
00:04:31.166 --> 00:04:34.708
you will begin to see truths again

79
00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:38.708
that were once out of reach.

80
00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:42.083
This will transform the perspective

81
00:04:42.083 --> 00:04:45.708
through which you saw yourself

82
00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:47.958
and the world.

83
00:04:52.875 --> 00:04:55.458
Come, tell me, in family

84
00:04:55.458 --> 00:04:58.458
life, what special responsibility

85
00:04:58.458 --> 00:05:02.125
do the elders have toward the young?

86
00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:03.708
Tell me.

87
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:06.125
All right, I will tell you.

88
00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:09.000
That special responsibility is

89
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.458
to help them live

90
00:05:11.458 --> 00:05:14.916
with the right understanding.

91
00:05:14.916 --> 00:05:16.708
Just as I

92
00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:19.666
gave Arjun divine sight to behold

93
00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:23.333
My Vishwarupa, in the same way

94
00:05:23.333 --> 00:05:26.625
you can give the younger generation

95
00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:29.458
eyes that see through the lens

96
00:05:29.458 --> 00:05:33.208
of knowledge and spirituality, so that

97
00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:38.166
they can see their own experiences.

98
00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:40.125
After studying here,

99
00:05:40.125 --> 00:05:43.958
the younger generation faces the big question

100
00:05:43.958 --> 00:05:47.833
of choosing a business or a job.

101
00:05:47.833 --> 00:05:51.083
Helping them understand that not only wealth

102
00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:54.041
or the ambition of position,

103
00:05:54.041 --> 00:05:56.666
but also family love

104
00:05:56.666 --> 00:06:00.625
and peace should be kept in mind.

105
00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:03.416
By giving them a broader perspective,

106
00:06:03.416 --> 00:06:07.666
you save them from the
blind race of materialism

107
00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:09.208
and bring them toward values

108
00:06:09.208 --> 00:06:14.750
and the true joy of family.

109
00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.625
Life

110
00:06:16.625 --> 00:06:21.500
is full of challenges and lessons.

111
00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.041
In such times, without the right perspective,

112
00:06:24.041 --> 00:06:28.291
becoming confused is natural.

113
00:06:28.291 --> 00:06:33.000
Share with them the kind of knowledge

114
00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.791
that saves them from pretence

115
00:06:35.791 --> 00:06:38.833
and helps them see further ahead.

116
00:06:38.833 --> 00:06:40.708
Teach them

117
00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:44.541
that failures are opportunities to grow.

118
00:06:44.541 --> 00:06:47.500
Kindness brings strength,

119
00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.666
and the purpose of life is not merely

120
00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:54.083
material success, but

121
00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:56.875
far deeper than that.

122
00:06:56.875 --> 00:06:59.625
When you help them gain a clear

123
00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:03.000
vision to see the world,

124
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.375
then they are able to face challenges

125
00:07:05.375 --> 00:07:07.750
with courage

126
00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:11.958
and nurture relationships with compassion.

127
00:07:11.958 --> 00:07:14.083
Use this vision

128
00:07:14.083 --> 00:07:16.750
for yourself too.

129
00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:20.875
See family situations not just as events,

130
00:07:20.875 --> 00:07:23.125
but as lessons

131
00:07:23.125 --> 00:07:27.208
and opportunities to grow together.

132
00:07:27.208 --> 00:07:32.500
When you look at life with
this deeper understanding,

133
00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:35.541
then your family becomes stronger.

134
00:07:35.541 --> 00:07:38.000
It becomes united

135
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:42.000
and is inspired to move towards a divine purpose

136
00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.416
As an elder in the family,

137
00:07:45.416 --> 00:07:49.083
with the light of your experiences

138
00:07:49.083 --> 00:07:53.541
keep illuminating the path of the new generation,

139
00:07:53.541 --> 00:07:56.041
move them forward too,

140
00:07:56.041 --> 00:07:58.500
and keep growing yourself as well.

141
00:08:03.291 --> 00:08:05.291
Come, think about this.

142
00:08:05.291 --> 00:08:07.666
The new challenges that come

143
00:08:07.666 --> 00:08:10.166
in life or business, can they every time

144
00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:13.208
be handled with the old methods?

145
00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:15.708
No, not at all.

146
00:08:15.708 --> 00:08:17.333
In professional life,

147
00:08:17.333 --> 00:08:20.083
to solve challenges, often

148
00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:21.500
situations must be seen

149
00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.125
from a different angle.

150
00:08:24.125 --> 00:08:26.500
Just as Arjun needed

151
00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.000
divine eyes to behold

152
00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:32.125
My Vishwarupa, in the same way

153
00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:36.833
sometimes you too, to find the right solution,

154
00:08:36.833 --> 00:08:41.625
must change your perspective.

155
00:08:41.625 --> 00:08:45.291
Seeing things from only one angle

156
00:08:45.291 --> 00:08:48.041
can make problems seem unsolvable,

157
00:08:48.041 --> 00:08:52.041
but when you think afresh

158
00:08:52.041 --> 00:08:54.750
or seek guidance from others,

159
00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:58.291
then a solution often begins to appear.

160
00:08:58.291 --> 00:08:59.791
For example,

161
00:08:59.791 --> 00:09:02.541
if a project faces obstacles,

162
00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:05.333
seeing it from the customer's perspective,

163
00:09:05.333 --> 00:09:09.625
or viewing it as a learning experience,

164
00:09:09.625 --> 00:09:12.416
reveals new paths to a solution.

165
00:09:12.416 --> 00:09:14.041
In the same way,

166
00:09:14.041 --> 00:09:17.291
when there are conflicts with colleagues,

167
00:09:17.291 --> 00:09:21.416
looking at the situation from their perspective

168
00:09:21.416 --> 00:09:26.708
brings both understanding and a solution.

169
00:09:26.708 --> 00:09:29.000
Expanding your perspective

170
00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.291
is like gaining a lens.

171
00:09:31.291 --> 00:09:33.500
With the help of this lens,

172
00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.416
you are able to see those options

173
00:09:36.416 --> 00:09:39.125
that you could not see before.

174
00:09:39.125 --> 00:09:42.416
Just as I gave Arjun,

175
00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:46.458
beyond ordinary sight, to see more,

176
00:09:46.458 --> 00:09:48.500
a divine vision,

177
00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:50.958
in the same way you too,

178
00:09:50.958 --> 00:09:55.125
give yourself a broader perspective,

179
00:09:55.125 --> 00:09:59.708
so that you can see opportunity even there

180
00:09:59.708 --> 00:10:04.250
where others see obstacles.

181
00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.250
Adopt a wider perspective.

182
00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.500
Through this, not only you, but

183
00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:15.458
those close to you too will certainly find success.
